Hello, everyone! I'm Mr. Daniel, your technology teacher.

3
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:12.866
Hi, Mr. Daniel! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.916 --> 00:00:16.531
Today we learn about Inclusive Design. Let's go!

5
00:00:17.647 --> 00:00:22.534
Inclusive design. Say it with me. Inclusive design!

6
00:00:26.047 --> 00:00:30.063
Disability. Say it with me. Disability!

7
00:00:33.594 --> 00:00:37.560
Language. Say it with me. Language!

8
00:00:41.021 --> 00:00:44.875
Diversity. Say it with me. Diversity!

9
00:00:48.399 --> 00:00:52.624
User testing. Say it with me. User testing!

10
00:00:56.103 --> 00:01:00.436
Accessibility. Say it with me. Accessibility!

11
00:01:03.951 --> 00:01:07.944
Empathy. Say it with me. Empathy!

12
00:01:11.413 --> 00:01:15.030
Barrier. Say it with me. Barrier!

13
00:01:18.543 --> 00:01:28.836
Inclusive design considers people of every ability, language, and background. User testing with diversity and empathy helps remove each barrier and improve accessibility.

14
00:01:28.886 --> 00:01:32.176
Now I understand. Thank you, Mr. Daniel!

15
00:01:33.054 --> 00:01:38.341
Look! What's the word?

16
