Language!

17
00:01:40.485 --> 00:01:45.693
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:45.743 --> 00:01:46.893
Empathy!

19
00:01:47.869 --> 00:01:53.453
Did you know? Designing for people with disabilities often improves products for everyone!

20
00:01:53.503 --> 00:01:55.629
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:56.840 --> 00:02:05.960
Think and answer. How can designers include people who speak different languages?

22
00:02:06.010 --> 00:02:07.160
Great answer!

23
00:02:08.307 --> 00:02:13.658
Great job today! Keep learning, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
